#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:7
msgid "Project visualization"
msgstr "项目可视化"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:9
msgid ""
"There is two different ways to manage the activation and hidden of opened "
"`projects`_. The `projects`_ can be organized with a `project tabs bar`_ "
"displayed at top from the `folio tabs bar`_ or with floating windows that "
"can be displayed or minimized."
msgstr ""
"管理已打开 `项目 <projects_>`_ 的激活与隐藏有两种不同方式。`项目 <projects_>`_ 可以通过显示在 `图幅标签栏 "
"<folio tabs bar_>`_ 上方的 `项目标签栏 <project tabs bar_>`_ 组织，也可以通过可显示或最小化的浮动窗口组织。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:13
msgid "To define the project visualization preference:"
msgstr "要设置项目显示方式的首选项："

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:15
msgid ""
"Select **Display > Display projects** menu item to display the project "
"visualization options."
msgstr "选择 **显示 > 显示项目** 菜单项，以显示项目显示选项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:16
msgid "Click on the desired option: **using windows** or **using tabs**"
msgstr "点击所需选项：**使用窗口** 或 **使用标签页**"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Display > Display projects menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 显示 > 显示项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:29
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech projects visualization using windows"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目以窗口方式显示"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/project_visualization.rst:33
msgid ""
"The project display preferences can also be defined at QElectroTech "
"`appearance`_ settings."
msgstr "项目显示设置也可以在 QElectroTech `外观 <appearance_>`_ 设置中定义。"
